{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運乒乓項目，港隊球手王婷莛奪得一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n王婷莛在女子11級單打決賽，面對日本球手山口美也。雙方要打足5局分負。王婷莛首局輸「刁時」10:12之後，連勝兩局11:8反先，山口美也第四局贏11:5追平局數2:2。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n決勝的第五局，王婷莛以5:11落敗，局數輸2:3，為港隊奪得一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.146390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:38:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:37:45.747881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:51.816621+00:00","content_hash":"a78bd2967a0d6a9babecf89ea2f5909c3632e0efa19bd54e819b6967cbf44cca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}